        },
        {
          "resource_id": "monster_action",
          "stats": {
            "action_name": {
              "value": "Smog Cloud"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(arcane, evocation, poison)\n\nThe daelum unleashes a cloud of smog in a 10-foot emanation. The cloud persists for 3 rounds, but doesn't move with the daelum. All creatures within the cloud are concealed. A creature that begins its turn in the smog cloud must attempt a 18 Fortitude save (creatures that must breathe and don't hold their breath take a \u20132 circumstance penalty on their save).\n\n- **Critical Success:** No effect and temporarily immune for 1 hour.\n- **Success:** The creature is sickened 1.\n- **Failure:** The creature is sickened 2.\n- **Critical Failure:** The creature is sickened 2 and slowed 1."
            },
            "action_type": {
